msgid ""
"Original welcome-sign copy pairing each state's well-known nickname with a "
"widely-documented fact or landmark; roadside register, facts not invented."
msgstr ""

msgid "Alabama"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Welcome to Alabama, the Yellowhammer State. Home of the rockets that "
"carried the first men to the moon, designed right here in Huntsville."
msgstr ""

msgid "Arizona"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Welcome to Arizona, the Grand Canyon State, where the canyon turns out to "
"be even bigger than the billboards promised."
msgstr ""

msgid "Arkansas"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Welcome to Arkansas, the Natural State. Home of a former president, and the "
"one place in America you can dig your own diamonds and keep them."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Welcome to California, the Golden State. More people, more traffic, and "
"more of that burger stand with the palm trees than you can shake a stick at."
msgstr ""

msgid "Colorado"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Welcome to Colorado, the Centennial State, where the plains finally quit "
"and the Rocky Mountains take over all at once."
msgstr ""

msgid "Connecticut"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Welcome to Connecticut, the Constitution State, birthplace of the "
"hamburger, the Frisbee, and a great many very old stone walls."
msgstr ""

msgid "Delaware"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Welcome to Delaware, the First State, first to ratify the Constitution and "
"proud enough to say so right on the sign."
msgstr ""

msgid "District of Columbia"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Welcome to the District of Columbia, the nation's capital. Monuments, "
"museums, and traffic circles that confuse everyone who drives them. "
"Including you."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Welcome to Florida, the Sunshine State. Oranges, alligators, and a theme "
"park about the size of a small country."
msgstr ""

msgid "Georgia"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Welcome to Georgia, the Peach State. Home of peaches, pecans, and the fizzy "
"brown drink that went and conquered the world."
msgstr ""

msgid "Idaho"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Welcome to Idaho, the Gem State. Famous potatoes. It says so right on the "
"license plate, so it must be true."
msgstr ""

msgid "Illinois"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Welcome to Illinois, the Prairie State. Land of Lincoln, deep-dish pizza, "
"and the start of the mother road, Route sixty-six."
msgstr ""

msgid "Indiana"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Welcome to Indiana, the Hoosier State, home of the greatest spectacle in "
"racing and more rows of corn than a driver can count."
msgstr ""

msgid "Iowa"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Welcome to Iowa, the Hawkeye State, where the corn is high, the ground is "
"flat, and somebody carved a baseball diamond into a cornfield."
msgstr ""

msgid "Kansas"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Welcome to Kansas, the Sunflower State. Flat as a tabletop, and yes, "
"Dorothy really was from here."
msgstr ""

msgid "Kentucky"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Welcome to Kentucky, the Bluegrass State. Bourbon, horse races, and fried "
"chicken worth crossing a state line for."
msgstr ""

msgid "Louisiana"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Welcome to Louisiana, the Pelican State, where the food is spicy, the music "
"never quite stops, and the swamp starts at the shoulder."
msgstr ""

msgid "Maine"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Welcome to Maine, the Pine Tree State. Lobster, lighthouses, and the very "
"first sunrise in the nation."
msgstr ""

msgid "Maryland"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Welcome to Maryland, the Old Line State. Crab cakes, and the harbor that "
"gave us the rockets' red glare."
msgstr ""

msgid "Massachusetts"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Welcome to Massachusetts, the Bay State, where the Revolution kicked off "
"and everybody still drives like it."
msgstr ""

msgid "Michigan"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Welcome to Michigan, the Great Lakes State. Hold up your right hand: that "
"is your map. Home of the automobile."
msgstr ""

msgid "Minnesota"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Welcome to Minnesota, the North Star State. Ten thousand lakes, give or "
"take, and winters that absolutely mean it."
msgstr ""

msgid "Mississippi"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Welcome to Mississippi, the Magnolia State, birthplace of the blues and "
"namesake of the mighty river on its western border."
msgstr ""

msgid "Missouri"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Welcome to Missouri, the Show-Me State, the gateway to the West, with a "
"giant steel arch to prove it."
msgstr ""

msgid "Montana"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Welcome to Montana, Big Sky Country. More cattle than people, and a sky "
"that earns the nickname every single evening."
msgstr ""

msgid "Nebraska"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Welcome to Nebraska, the Cornhusker State. Corn, corn-fed beef, and the "
"original Cabela's waiting for you out on Interstate eighty."
msgstr ""

msgid "Nevada"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Welcome to Nevada, the Silver State, where the desert glitters after dark "
"and the odds are never quite in your favor."
msgstr ""

msgid "New Hampshire"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Welcome to New Hampshire, the Granite State. Live free or die, and no sales "
"tax. They are not kidding about either one."
msgstr ""

msgid "New Jersey"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Welcome to New Jersey, the Garden State. It really is a garden once you are "
"past the turnpike, and somebody else will pump your gas."
msgstr ""

msgid "New Mexico"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Welcome to New Mexico, the Land of Enchantment. Red or green chile on "
"everything, and night skies the flying-saucer crowd swears by."
msgstr ""

msgid "New York"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Welcome to New York, the Empire State. One very large city, and an even "
"larger amount of state that nobody ever tells you about."
msgstr ""

msgid "North Carolina"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Welcome to North Carolina, the Tar Heel State, first in flight and home of "
"the original pulled-pork argument."
msgstr ""

msgid "North Dakota"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Welcome to North Dakota, the Peace Garden State, home of the world's "
"largest buffalo and a whole highway lined with giant metal sculptures."
msgstr ""

msgid "Ohio"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Welcome to Ohio, the Buckeye State, birthplace of aviation and more "
"astronauts and presidents than really seems fair to the other states."
msgstr ""

msgid "Oklahoma"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Welcome to Oklahoma, the Sooner State, where the wind comes sweeping down "
"the plain, exactly like the song promised."
msgstr ""

msgid "Oregon"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Welcome to Oregon, the Beaver State. Waterfalls, giant trees, and a "
"coastline that fights the Pacific to a draw."
msgstr ""

msgid "Pennsylvania"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Welcome to Pennsylvania, the Keystone State, where the country was founded "
"and the sandwiches come smothered in cheese."
msgstr ""

msgid "Rhode Island"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Welcome to Rhode Island, the Ocean State. Small enough to cross on your "
"lunch break, and serious about coffee milk and hot wieners."
msgstr ""

msgid "South Carolina"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Welcome to South Carolina, the Palmetto State, home of a giant sombrero "
"tower."
msgstr ""

msgid "South Dakota"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Welcome to South Dakota, the Mount Rushmore State. Four presidents carved "
"into a mountain, and free ice water down the road at Wall Drug."
msgstr ""

msgid "Tennessee"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Welcome to Tennessee, the Volunteer State. Music City, Graceland, and hot "
"chicken that fights back."
msgstr ""

msgid "Texas"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Welcome to Texas, the Lone Star State, where everything really is bigger, "
"including the drive to get across it."
msgstr ""

msgid "Utah"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Welcome to Utah, the Beehive State. Red-rock arches, blinding salt flats, "
"and a lake you can float in like a cork."
msgstr ""

msgid "Vermont"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Welcome to Vermont, the Green Mountain State. Maple syrup, covered bridges, "
"and ice cream from Waterbury."
msgstr ""

msgid "Virginia"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Welcome to Virginia, the Old Dominion, birthplace of a whole shelf of "
"presidents, and, so the sign insists, for lovers."
msgstr ""

msgid "Washington"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Welcome to Washington, the Evergreen State. Coffee, rain, apples, and a "
"volcano keeping a quiet eye on things."
msgstr ""

msgid "West Virginia"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Welcome to West Virginia, the Mountain State. Almost heaven, they say, and "
"the roads do wind exactly like the song."
msgstr ""

msgid "Wisconsin"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Welcome to Wisconsin, the Badger State. Cheese, more cheese, and a giant "
"waterpark town they simply call the Dells."
msgstr ""

msgid "Wyoming"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Welcome to Wyoming, the Equality State, first to let women vote, home of "
"Old Faithful and a great deal of wide-open nobody."
msgstr ""

