msgid "Northstar Freight Lines: balanced company driver"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Balanced company-driver start with steady wages, normal training support, "
"and assigned carrier equipment."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"A balanced company-driver path. The carrier assigns and maintains the "
"tractor, pays fuel and routine repairs, and offers steady wage math without "
"a sharp specialty."
msgstr ""

msgid "Great Lakes Training Transport: trainer-friendly company driver"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Trainer-friendly company start with stronger stop pay, more short rookie "
"loads, and a little more appointment slack."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"A practical training-fleet start. Stop pay is better on short loads, and "
"dispatch leans toward shorter training work with a little more deadline "
"room. Equipment and routine costs stay carrier-paid. At level 4 with full "
"dispatch trust, Business status lets you move to another carrier."
msgstr ""

