"On the final approach, after any exit, it works the throttle and brakes: up "
"to 12 miles per hour through the facility lane, creeping the last 200 feet, "
"then stopping at pickup and delivery facilities, rest stops, and required "
"weigh stations. It never chooses an exit, enters a yard, or docks. In a "
"chain-law area it stops to put snow chains on and take them off, and it may "
"spend on-duty minutes on chains: about 30 to chain up, 10 to take them off. "
"It never buys chains. Realistic leaves it off; Balanced and All assists "
"turn it on."
msgstr ""

msgid "Curve assistance"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Takes mapped bends for you: slows to the advised speed on the service "
"brakes, never the engine brake, and holds the wheel through the bend and "
"through street corners. On a real downgrade it does raise the jake. While "
"it steers, the engine leans only when you drift. Lane keeping is a separate "
"setting and holds you between the lines the rest of the time."
msgstr ""

msgid "Route-transition assistance"
msgstr ""

msgid "Speed and lane help at confirmed route transitions."
msgstr ""

msgid "Latching brake"
msgstr ""

#. placeholders: {control_brake}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid ""
"One press of {control_brake} releases it; the accelerator releases it "
"instantly."
msgstr ""

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "Presets never change this."
msgstr ""

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid ""
"Tap the brake, then press again and hold half a second: a click and a "
"spoken confirmation latch it hands-free."
msgstr ""

#. placeholders: {control_brake}
msgid ""
"Tap the brake, then press again and hold half a second: a click and a "
"spoken confirmation latch it hands-free. One press of {control_brake} "
"releases it; the accelerator releases it instantly. The throttle key never "
"latches. Presets never change this."
msgstr ""

msgid "Predictive cruise"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Cruise reads the road a mile and a half ahead: a little extra speed before "
"a climb, easing at a crest, no speed added before a descent. It says what "
"it is doing once per hill. Presets never change this."
msgstr ""

msgid "Curve callouts"
msgstr ""

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid ""
"Bends that demand slowing are called before they arrive, like Sharp left, "
"half a mile, advise 35."
msgstr ""

#. placeholders: {control_upcoming}
msgid ""
"Bends that demand slowing are called before they arrive, like Sharp left, "
"half a mile, advise 35. Bends you are already slow enough for stay silent. "
"Press {control_upcoming} to list the next few either way. Presets never "
"change this."
msgstr ""

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "Bends you are already slow enough for stay silent."
msgstr ""

#. placeholders: {control_upcoming}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "Press {control_upcoming} to list the next few either way."
msgstr ""

msgid "Speed keeper"
msgstr ""

#. placeholders: {control_cruise}
#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid ""
"In low-speed zones, like facility roads, gates, and construction zones, "
"{control_cruise} holds your current speed, then hands back to adaptive "
"cruise on open roads."
msgstr ""

#. placeholders: {control_cruise}
msgid ""
"In low-speed zones, like facility roads, gates, and construction zones, "
"{control_cruise} holds your current speed, then hands back to adaptive "
"cruise on open roads. It eases off early for the next turn or the next "
"lower limit. Braking cancels the session. Presets never change this."
msgstr ""

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "It eases off early for the next turn or the next lower limit."
msgstr ""

#. placeholders: {language_label}
msgid "Language: {language_label}"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Automatic follows your system language. Radio and recorded voices stay in "
"English."
msgstr ""

#. placeholders: {score_display_label}
msgid "Score display: {score_display_label}"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Choose whether reputation and dispatch trust read both their descriptive "
"band and score, only the score, or only the description. A trust score is "
"spoken only when service sets its band."
msgstr ""

#. placeholders: {replace}
msgid "Driving speech: {replace}"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"How much the road tells you. Standard speaks every confirmation, status "
"update and traffic call, and a driving tip once per leg. Quiet speaks short "
"confirmations, lane openings, and status updates, but not the traffic "
"around you or tips. Urgent only keeps safety warnings and directions "
"requiring action. What a setting leaves out makes no sound and stays out of "
"the event buffer. Readout keys always answer. Billboards, place names, and "
"landmarks have their own switches below."
msgstr ""

#. placeholders: {chatter_summary}
msgid "Roadside chatter: {chatter_summary}"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Color between navigation cues: parks, rivers, mountain passes, museums, and "
"billboards. Right arrow turns all on, Left arrow all off; the switches "
"below pick each kind. Safety and navigation are never affected. Town names "
"are the Place callouts row below."
msgstr ""

#. placeholders: {on_off}
msgid "Speak parks and forests: {on_off}"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Callouts entering a national park, national forest, or other protected "
"public land."
msgstr ""

#. placeholders: {on_off}
msgid "Speak river crossings: {on_off}"
msgstr ""

