#. placeholders: {else}
msgid "Transmission: {else}"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Automatic shifts for you. Manual uses the clutch with W and Q to shift up "
"and down."
msgstr ""

#. placeholders: {automatic_direction_changes}
msgid "Automatic direction changes: {automatic_direction_changes}"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Both styles change direction with a fresh press at a standstill; a brake "
"held through a stop just holds the truck. Deliberate requires the release "
"and press everywhere. Automatic transmission only."
msgstr ""

