msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Draws the road, the dashboard, menus and captions of what is spoken in the "
"game window, for sighted and low-vision players. Off keeps the window dark "
"and saves battery. Speech and sound are the same either way."
msgstr ""

#. placeholders: {on_off}
msgid "Menu accelerator keys: {on_off}"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"When on, typing a unique first letter immediately activates that menu item. "
"Shared initials only move between matches; press Enter to activate. Off "
"only moves the selection."
msgstr ""

