"answers: a stutter clipping the rumble strip, a buzz fully on it, gravel "
"off the pavement."
msgstr ""

#. placeholders: {acc_gap_label}
msgid "Following gap: {acc_gap_label}"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"How much room adaptive cruise leaves to the vehicle ahead. Close is two and "
"a half seconds, normal three, far three and a half. Weather widens the gap "
"whichever you pick. All three stay clear of a following-too-close citation. "
"The preset above never changes it."
msgstr ""

