"automatic road-journal posts generated from gameplay. Public updates can "
"also appear in the Freight Fate updates feed. Each post also tells "
"orinks.net which game version you are running, used only for moderation and "
"troubleshooting and never shown publicly. Freight Fate does not publish "
"your real name, full save, coordinates, active cargo details, or precise "
"real-world location. Detailed career statistics come only from your public "
"career's latest accepted private backup, which you choose on the Cloud "
"backup menu. They include lifetime career earnings, the running total your "
"career has ever earned; the money you currently have is never published. "
"The backups themselves stay private to your account and never appear as "
"public downloads. Turning Profile sharing off hides public details but does "
"not turn cloud backup off."
