msgid "Energy drink"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"A cold energy drink from the cooler. A small instant lift, and for the next "
"two hours the miles tire you more slowly. A new drink or meal replaces the "
"old one; they do not stack."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"You down the energy drink. You feel a little sharper, and the next couple "
"of hours on the road will tire you more slowly."
msgstr ""

msgid "The energy drink has worn off."
msgstr ""

msgid "Diner meal"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"A proper hot meal. Takes half an hour, eases fatigue right away, and for "
"the next four hours the driving tires you more slowly. Counts as your "
"30-minute break."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"You sit down to a hot meal and push the plate away satisfied. The next four "
"hours of driving will tire you more slowly."
msgstr ""

msgid "That meal has worn off; the road is starting to drag again."
msgstr ""

msgid "Iron Skillet dinner"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The Iron Skillet is Petro's famous sit-down restaurant, and it beats any "
"diner on the road: a big instant lift and five hours of slower fatigue. "
"Takes 45 minutes, and counts as your 30-minute break."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"You take your time over a full Iron Skillet dinner. You feel genuinely "
"restored, and the next five hours of driving will tire you more slowly."
msgstr ""

msgid "The Iron Skillet dinner has worn off."
msgstr ""

msgid "Shower"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Pilot and Flying J are known for their showers -- and a fuel purchase here "
"makes it free, just like real life. You come out fresh: an instant lift and "
"three hours of slower fatigue."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"A hot shower and a clean shirt. You feel fresh, and the next few hours of "
"driving will tire you more slowly."
msgstr ""

msgid "That fresh-from-the-shower feeling has faded."
msgstr ""

msgid "Big Buck's smoked brisket plate"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The best plate of food on any highway, and worth the trouble it takes to "
"get a truck in here: the biggest instant lift in the game and six hours of "
"slower fatigue."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The brisket lives up to every billboard. You feel like a new driver, and "
"the next six hours on the road will barely touch you."
msgstr ""

msgid "The brisket glow has faded. Big Buck's is a long way back."
msgstr ""

msgid "Five-cent coffee"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Wall Drug's famous five-cent coffee. A small instant lift, and for the next "
"hour and a half the miles tire you a little more slowly. Weaker than an "
"energy drink; a meal does more. A new drink or meal replaces the old one; "
"they do not stack."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"You drink the five-cent coffee. You feel a little more awake, and the next "
"hour and a half on the road will tire you a little more slowly."
msgstr ""

msgid "The five-cent coffee has worn off."
msgstr ""

msgid "Free ice water"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Free ice water, just like the billboards promise. A tiny instant lift and "
"three-quarters of an hour of slightly slower fatigue. Less than the "
"five-cent coffee."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"You drink the free ice water. A small cool-down, and the next short stretch "
"of road will tire you a little more slowly."
msgstr ""

msgid "The free ice water has worn off."
msgstr ""

msgid "Quick lube and oil service"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Speedco built its name on fast lube bays, and Love's runs them too. Fresh "
"oil and a once-over: the engine wears a quarter slower for the rest of this "
"trip. Over-revving and lugging still hurt it full price. Company drivers "
"bill the carrier."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Fresh oil, new filters, and a clean bill of health. The engine will wear "
"more slowly for the rest of this trip."
msgstr ""

msgid "Tire check and rotation"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The tire bay checks pressures and rotates the set. Evenly worn tires wear "
"slower: a fifth less tread wear for the rest of this trip. Company drivers "
"bill the carrier."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Pressures set and tires rotated. The tread will wear more slowly for the "
"rest of this trip."
msgstr ""

msgid "Premium diesel additive"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"A bottle of fuel treatment in the tank. A small kindness to the engine: it "
"wears a tenth slower for the rest of this trip. A lube-bay service does "
"more where you can find one. Company drivers bill the carrier."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"You pour the additive in with the fuel. The engine will wear a little more "
"slowly for the rest of this trip."
msgstr ""

